```

We'll change to:

```
    // === RENDER =============================================================
    function render() {
      ctx.fillStyle = '#0f1320';
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
    }

    // === INPUT ==============================================================
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (ev) => {
      if (ev.key === 'r' || ev.key === 'R') { reset(); return; }
      keys.add(ev.key);
    });
    document.addEventListener('keyup', (ev) => { keys.delete(ev.key); });
    restartBtn.addEventListener('click', reset);

    // === BOOT ===============================================================
    reset();
    startLoop();
```

Make sure we close parentheses correctly and no issues. Also need to ensure we haven't introduced references to keys before it's defined; but keys is defined in STATE before.

